        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Warren Fu, Aaliyah, R. Kelly, Daft Punk, The Weeknd, Snoop Dogg, Pharrell Williams, The Strokes, HAIM, The Killers, Depeche Mode, Weezer, Mark Ronson, Julian Casablancas\n- Companies: Jive, Atlantic Records\n- Works: “Soothe My Soul”\n\nFacts:\n- Aaliyah ended her contract with Jive and signed with Atlantic Records after allegations of an illegal marriage with R. Kelly.\n- The music video for “Soothe My Soul,” directed by Warren Fu, premiered on 28 March 2013.\n- Warren Fu has directed promos for Daft Punk, The Weeknd, Snoop Dogg, Pharrell Williams, The Strokes, HAIM, The Killers, Depeche Mode, Weezer, Mark Ronson, Julian Casablancas, and Aaliyah.",
